# Provenance marker written by the iOS build scripts (local only): the profile
# line plus the rust-input-digest output. The glob also covers the .tmp staging
# file those scripts write to before the atomic mv (#813).
rust-profile-ios.txt*

# No lockfile here on purpose (same rule as orbital-signal, #798). This package
# is a `file:` dependency of the app root, so its one dependency
# (uniffi-bindgen-react-native) resolves into the ROOT package-lock.json and
# `ubrn` runs from the root node_modules/.bin. A sub-lock would be an orphan
# peer closure pinned at a different react-native than the app, installed by
# nothing and audited by nothing. Never run `npm install` in this directory.
package-lock.json
node_modules/
